{
 "nodes": [
  {
   "id": "cap-title",
   "type": "text",
   "x": -1900,
   "y": -460,
   "width": 1500,
   "height": 150,
   "text": "# One layer in detail — L1 (MoE, own indexer)  \nGrey bars = tensors (length ∝ channels, 0.04 px/channel), boxes = ops with their weight shapes from the checkpoint. T = tokens, K = cached past tokens. Layers marked *reuses top-k* skip the orange indexer column and take its top-2048 picks from the last indexer layer; L0 swaps the MoE for a dense SwiGLU FFN."
  },
